Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:12.70,Title,0,0,0,0,,《蝙蝠侠与罗宾》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要车的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicks dig the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.70,0:02:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是超人总是一个人行动的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why Superman works alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试把这辆车完整的开回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do try and bring this one back in one piece, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要等我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't wait up, Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会取消那些披萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cancel the pizzas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.76,0:03:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batman,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.39,0:03:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个新的坏人霸占了哥谭博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}a new villain has commandeered the Gotham Museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.81,0:03:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些古董的翅膀被冻住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's frozen the antiquities wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些保安也变成了冰块\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's turned the security guards into ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.56,0:03:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他称他自己为急冻先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's calling himself, "Mr. Freeze."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,急冻先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.13,0:04:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即停止 放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Drop your weapon…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.93,0:04:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我要开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we'll shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,急冻人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Iceman Cometh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 请你有点怜悯之心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, show some mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.86,0:04:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怜悯？？？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mercy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我现在的条件 只允许我对你的恳求来一些冷冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid that my condition has left me cold to your pleas of mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.20,0:04:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.88,0:04:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.22,0:04:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this universe…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一种绝对\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's only one absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.31,0:05:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.27,0:05:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}freezes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 急冻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.01,0:05:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会也把我冷冻吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not sending me to the cooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.99,0:05:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,接的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把它打碎了 就要把他买下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You break it, you buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.78,0:05:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住珠宝 把那些人都杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab the gem! Kill the heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.59,0:06:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀掉他们 杀掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them! Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.43,0:06:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭一切！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是从地狱来的曲棍球队\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the hockey team from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去拿那个钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the ice…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.90,0:07:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来对付那个冰人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get the Iceman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.63,0:07:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:07:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙为什么灭绝呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What killed the dinosaurs?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是冰河\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ice Age!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 小子们！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit me, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.80,0:09:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊谢谢你来玩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原本就希望你们会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping you'd drop in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.58,0:10:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the numbers…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.77,0:10:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你末日的预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}for they are the harbingers of your doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能感觉到吗？？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel it coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.69,0:10:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个冰冷的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}The icy cold of space.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.00,0:10:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.19,0:10:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在三千英尺的高度 你的心脏都会冰冻起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}At 30, 000 feet your heart will freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.11,0:10:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再跳动\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and beat no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.83,0:10:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你被冻住以后 你的冰墓就会垂直落回到哥谭镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you're frozen, your icy tomb will plummet back to Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.92,0:10:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,急冻人 你这个疯子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze, you're mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦这个爆炸 成千上万的人都会死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This capsule explodes it'll slaughter thousands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.59,0:11:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,冻的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁请你来的？- 我只是在附近 经过而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who invited you? - I was hanging around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.87,0:11:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你会留在博物馆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd stay in the museum, round up some thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.87,0:11:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不这么说 「非常高兴你能够来救我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about, "Nice to see you. Thanks for saving my life."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个蝙蝠炸弹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Batbomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须在哥谭镇变成一个弹坑之前把这个吹起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must blow this up before it turns Gotham into a crater.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.81,0:11:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？叫辆出租车？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what, call a taxi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己看第一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the first step!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲浪准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surf's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.23,0:12:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,接住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.69,0:12:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉很不错！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cowabunga!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.71,0:13:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要把炉子也冻起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's freezing the furnace!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.67,0:13:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到他了 洛宾 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay cool…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.22,0:13:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,会飞的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Birdboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.44,0:14:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能变冷吗？蝙蝠侠 你有11分钟来给这个孩子解冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you be cold? You have 11 minutes to thaw the bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会怎么办呢？？继续去追坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you chase the villain…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是救这个孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or save him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.95,0:14:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 你的情感让你变得脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emotion makes you weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么今天是属于我的 哈哈哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why this day is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.42,0:14:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下次一定要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.25,0:15:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓住他了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.27,0:15:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drats!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的试验是培育出食人兰花 和南美响尾蛇 但是都失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My experiment to mate the orchid and the rattlesnake has failed again…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.11,0:15:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是抱着希望 尤其是在动物植物的杂交配种方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I still have hope for the animal-plant crossbreedings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只需要我找出毒液的正确剂量\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can only find the right dose of venom…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.95,0:15:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些植物就可以象动物那样凶狠的战斗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…these plants will be able to fight back, like animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.12,0:15:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用花神的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have given flora…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.12,0:15:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,去反击无知男人带来的破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}a chance against the thoughtless ravages of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,个人记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personal note:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.88,0:15:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工作可以更快的进行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My work would proceed faster…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.05,0:15:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果Woodrue博士往他的神秘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Dr Woodrue didn't whisk my venom samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.81,0:16:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉尔加美什翅膀加入我的毒液样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}…back to his mysterious Gilgamesh Wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.23,0:16:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么不让我进入他的实验室呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why won't he let me in the lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.56,0:16:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.61,0:16:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这儿干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.08,0:16:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,未联合王国的女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen of the un-United Nations…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.71,0:16:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,和\N{\fnArial\fs30}and.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.84,0:16:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的神秘买主\N{\fnArial\fs30}…our mystery bidder…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}…may I present…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼奥 迪亚哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Antonio Diego…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.31,0:16:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,连环杀手 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}…serial murderer, serving life…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在监狱里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.73,0:16:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且唯一生还的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and sole surviving…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.94,0:16:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,志愿者\N{\fnArial\fs30}volunteer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.27,0:16:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是多么的迷人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what a charmer he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能够把那三个同心洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}By merely drilling three concentric holes directly…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.20,0:17:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接放到安东尼奥的颅腔里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}into Antonio's cranial cavity I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.12,0:17:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经在他大脑的最原始的部分创造了一个间道\N{\fnArial\fs30}…created viaducts into the most primitive part of his brain…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.75,0:17:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是边缘系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}the limbic system.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么现在我就要加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I add…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的超级军人的血清\N{\fnArial\fs30}my Super-Soldier Serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.22,0:17:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,编好代码的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…code-named…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.89,0:17:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Venom"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,加到那个自己我开的类固醇\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to which I add my very own recipe of steroids…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.47,0:17:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,和霉素的处方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and toxins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.98,0:17:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他放进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plug him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,尖叫的时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.82,0:17:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.85,0:18:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,天才！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.93,0:18:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,理想毁灭了机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ideal killing machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.81,0:18:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫这个小数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call this little number…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.44,0:18:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,祸害\N{\fnArial\fs30}…"Bane."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.02,0:18:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,人性的祸害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane of Humanity!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.11,0:18:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.86,0:18:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的私人军队由成千上万这些超级战士组成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your own private army made up of thousands of these super-soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.45,0:18:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫价至少从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bidding begins at a mere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.45,0:18:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千万起\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,加速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turbo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.66,0:18:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,给爸爸炫耀一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show off for Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.33,0:19:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.12,0:19:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isley博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Isley.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来做客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to my parlor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.09,0:19:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个怪物！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.47,0:19:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的赞助人不能容忍军事应用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our original sponsor had no stomach for military applications.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.60,0:19:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他断了我们的资金\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cut the funding for our work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without your research…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.06,0:19:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你的研究我就不能有现在的成绩\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I couldn't have come this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.73,0:19:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two of us entwined side by side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经致力于保护濒危植物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have spent my life trying to protect plants from extinction…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的疯狂计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and now you…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁了我的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}corrupt my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.74,0:19:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了控制世界？\N{\fnArial\fs30}into some maniacal scheme for world domination?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I get through…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.25,0:20:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就没机会再教高中化学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't be able to get a job teaching high school chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.13,0:20:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.72,0:20:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个变态？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You psycho!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.26,0:20:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尊重你的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can respect your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.77,0:20:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是 我不喜欢被拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly, I'm not good at rejection.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.64,0:20:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你不得不去死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid you'll have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 ！好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.51,0:20:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这些毒药和霉素给你锻造一个坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the poisons and toxins burn a grave for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.51,0:20:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个你很喜爱的地球深处！\N{\fnArial\fs30}…deep into the earth you love so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 亲爱的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.51,0:20:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fellow maniacs…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.14,0:20:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫价\N{\fnArial\fs30}…bidding…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.93,0:20:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始！\N{\fnArial\fs30}begins!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.19,0:21:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,两年前哥谭大学实验室保安闭路电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotham University Labs security video, 2 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.78,0:21:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,维克多 福莱斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr Victor Fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.49,0:21:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,两届奥运混十项全能和分子生物学诺贝尔奖获得者\N{\fnArial\fs30}2-time Olympic decathlete and Nobel Prize winner for molecular biology.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.20,0:21:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她妻子得了一种稀有的病\N{\fnArial\fs30}After his wife contracted a rare disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦氏综合症后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Macgregor's Syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.21,0:21:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他希望把它冻起来 知道他找到解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he hoped to freeze her in a cryogenic sleep until he could find a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.55,0:21:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是现在越来越冷的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, here's where everything goes north.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.30,0:21:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.22,0:21:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太痛苦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's got to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.68,0:21:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些液体是零下50度\N{\fnArial\fs30}That liquid is 50 below.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.18,0:21:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种程度上他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, he survived somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.02,0:21:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的身体在冷冻状态下变异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cryo-solution mutated his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他妻子怎么了？- 没人知道确切的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to his wife? - No one knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.03,0:21:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们以为她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's presumed dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.74,0:21:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能在极度寒冷下生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze needs extreme cold to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.87,0:21:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的冷冻服是用的钻石增强镭射材料 以保持他的身体在零度一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}His cryo-suit uses diamond-enhanced lasers to keep him at zero degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.21,0:22:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 如果这是冰 那冰人想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's ice the Iceman wants…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.43,0:22:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.85,0:22:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.60,0:22:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.22,0:22:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要韦恩钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need the Wayne diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把自己困成雪人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We going to trap a snowman?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.73,0:22:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是 就在你在模拟器里训练10小时之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Right after you spend 10 hours in the simulator training.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.78,0:22:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞错了 对不起 这个不会发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a mistake. I'm sorry. It won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.40,0:22:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么不计后果 几乎自己死于冷冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were reckless and almost got killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.61,0:22:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 看到了吗？我 在这里 活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine! See! Me, here, alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.28,0:22:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不信任我 我们怎么在一起工作呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we supposed to work together if you won't trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.41,0:22:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要多么信任？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How indeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.75,0:22:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他太渴望和冲动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's overeager, he's impulsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.09,0:22:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能信任他不被伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't trust him not to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.05,0:22:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上你也许不信任任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the truth is you really don't trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.05,0:22:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要告诉我你又站在他那边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me you're on his side again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.76,0:22:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管你很有天分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite all your talents…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.31,0:23:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍然不懂得选择方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you're still just a novice in the ways of family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.64,0:23:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dick先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Dick…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.81,0:23:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你用的同一种方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}follows the same star as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.48,0:23:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是通过自己的方法达到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but gets there by his own course.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.07,0:23:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须学会信任他 因为这是这个定义的本质\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must learn to trust him, for that is the nature of family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.66,0:23:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信任你 Alfred\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.62,0:23:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不可能永远在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I shan't be here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 Bruce先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Master Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.67,0:23:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 Alfred\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.52,0:23:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 亲爱的Bruce先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear, Master Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.69,0:23:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 很乱嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good gracious, what a tumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.36,0:23:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好勇敢的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a brave boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.71,0:24:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.54,0:24:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常高兴你赢得拍卖 你太无情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so pleased you won the bidding. Your Supreme Ruthlessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.84,0:24:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就做最后的修改\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're making the final modifications on Bane right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.13,0:24:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有个无与媲美的超级战士通过晚间快递 明天一早就到你那里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have a flawless super-soldier out to you tomorrow by overnight mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.29,0:24:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.03,0:24:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isley博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr Isley?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.87,0:24:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦？帕梅拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.87,0:24:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.87,0:24:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其对一个死去的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially for a dead woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.04,0:24:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 Jason\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Jason!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.21,0:24:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我已经换了一个心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I've had a change of heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.22,0:24:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or quite literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.10,0:25:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,动植物霉素有个适当的单一影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}the animal-plant toxins had a rather unique effect on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.23,0:25:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把我的血换成了芦荟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They replaced my blood with aloe…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.06,0:25:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮肤换成了叶绿素\N{\fnArial\fs30}my skin with chlorophyll!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.40,0:25:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且填满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and filled…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.19,0:25:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}my lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.46,0:25:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,呣\N{\fnArial\fs30}En!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.25,0:25:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}with venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.08,0:25:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对了 Jason 还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Jason one other thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.96,0:25:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该早点发现说起这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I probably should have mentioned this earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.59,0:25:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.59,0:25:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒药\N{\fnArial\fs30}poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.11,0:25:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.64,0:25:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是个生死关头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a jungle in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.81,0:25:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个自然界的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Nature's arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.48,0:25:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的精神！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.03,0:25:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的意志！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her will!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.11,0:25:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 我是大自然母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I am Mother Nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.74,0:26:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在该是植物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the time has come…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.95,0:26:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新控制世界的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for plants to take back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.99,0:26:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界就是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world so rightfully ours…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.00,0:26:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because it's not nice…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.83,0:26:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,去欺骗大自然母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to fool with Mother Nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.51,0:26:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,「韦恩企业」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Wayne Enterprises."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.99,0:26:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}En!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.14,0:26:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了！亲爱的祸害！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming! Bane, darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.60,0:26:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还要赶飞机呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a plane to catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.16,0:26:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是冰柱先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Mr. Icicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.08,0:26:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Ten Below先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Mr. Ten Below.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.08,0:26:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱吧 唱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sing! Sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.34,0:26:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀 唱罢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.34,0:27:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,再大声一点 ！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louder! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.89,0:27:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱罢！唱罢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sing! Sing! Sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.97,0:27:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和白色圣诞先生是一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's Mr. White Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.18,0:27:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,再大声一点 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louder!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.27,0:27:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是冰柱先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's Mr. Icicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.90,0:27:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷冻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freezy…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.73,0:27:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得很热\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm feeling hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.73,0:27:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那不太可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find that unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.36,0:27:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那么我的头发很脆弱 我的皮肤也很干燥\N{\fnArial\fs30}So my hair is brittle and my skin is dry…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.07,0:27:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了得到你 我就要使用暴风雪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'd weather blizzards to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.49,0:27:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我所认识的最完美的男人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the most perfect man I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.20,0:27:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我们把这儿所有的东西都加热怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's heat things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.58,0:27:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的感情驱使我把我的新娘解冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}My passion thaws for my bride alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.92,0:27:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说你冰冷的肩膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about your cold shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.93,0:27:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 老大？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.22,0:27:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.68,0:27:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟那个蝙蝠战斗简直耗尽了我的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Battling the Bat exhausted my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.17,0:27:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.69,0:27:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.32,0:27:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍然是赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I was successful nevertheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.86,0:28:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.40,0:28:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,再有一个这么大的巨型钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more giant diamond of this size,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.16,0:28:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的能量就又都会补充回来啦 哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my freezing engine will be complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.33,0:28:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会把整个城市都冻起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will freeze the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.33,0:28:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 我就可以用哥谭镇来进行敲诈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I will hold Gotham ransom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.25,0:28:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到这个城市把钻石都给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless the city bows to my demands…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.88,0:28:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥谭镇永远都是冬天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's winter forever in Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.26,0:28:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city fathers will have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.88,0:28:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有给我所有我需要的经费 来完成我的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but to give me the billions I need to complete my research…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.06,0:28:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的话 我就可以找到一个治疗的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so I can find a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.44,0:28:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.06,0:28:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.27,0:28:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要高质量的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need quality time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.00,0:28:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 我们又可以重新在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon we will be together once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.92,0:29:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.05,0:29:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.49,0:29:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.96,0:29:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定是不小心睡着了 十分对不起先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must've dozed off. My sincerest apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.96,0:29:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 Alfred\N{\fnArial\fs30}No apology necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.75,0:29:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是三十年来发生的头一回\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the first time it's happened in thirty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.52,0:29:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please be looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.52,0:30:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上我来找我Alfred叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I'm looking for Alfred Pennyworth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.72,0:30:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alfred叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Alfred!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.95,0:30:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alfred叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Alfred!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.74,0:30:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.24,0:30:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 亲爱的 ！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.24,0:30:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,天大的一个惊喜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what a most wonderful surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.91,0:30:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么大的世界你是怎么找来的啊？毕竟从英国出来又那么多的路线呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you manage to come here all the way from England?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.08,0:30:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦亲爱的 你对你年老的叔叔还真是礼貌呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear, you are so kind to your old uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.46,0:30:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,叔叔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.80,0:30:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,芭芭拉是我妹妹玛格丽特的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barbara is the daughter of my dear sister Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.80,0:30:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母5年前因为一场以外去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both my parents were killed in a car accident 5 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.39,0:30:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那个时候开始 Alfred叔叔就一直照顾我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Alfred's been supporting me ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.97,0:30:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有秘密？？- 秘密？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have? - Secrets, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.93,0:30:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这所房子里面的每个人都有秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secrets are a virtual prerequisite in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.27,0:30:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.40,0:30:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正好是从\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on break from…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.57,0:30:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛津剑桥大学 爱福来德的母校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxbridge Academy, Alfred's alma mater.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.95,0:30:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的电脑科学分过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new computer sciences division.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.99,0:30:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道？- 你的制服上有标签啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd you know? - Says so on the patch on your sweater.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.17,0:31:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个是 ？真漂亮 - 你可以再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? It's beautiful - You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.17,0:31:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是辆赛车 我正在修理\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a competition racer. I've been fixing it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.13,0:31:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有空我会教你怎么开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you how to ride it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.63,0:31:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是吧 ？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You certainly will not!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.63,0:31:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心！Alfred叔叔 我会被这些东西吓坏！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry! Uncle Alfred, I'm terrified of these things!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.43,0:31:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,芭芭拉 我希望你能在这儿住下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barbara, I hope you'll stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.31,0:31:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我不知道可不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.02,0:31:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些豪华的东西根本不是我的风格 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this luxury really isn't my style, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.98,0:31:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是非常愿意留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.82,0:31:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 就这么说定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.65,0:31:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 可是 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, sir, we…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.15,0:31:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会变得非常忙碌啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we do get so busy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.49,0:31:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了 Alfred\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.86,0:31:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论怎么说 她都是个家人嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, she's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.88,0:31:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alfred叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Alfred?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.05,0:31:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来打搅你一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to tuck you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.06,0:31:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来打搅我？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came to tuck me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.64,0:32:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正好休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's quite a switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.69,0:32:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊你在弄什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you working on?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.35,0:32:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在努力寻找我的哥哥 你的另一个叔叔 Wilfred\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to find my brother, your Uncle Wilfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.23,0:32:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是米兰加泊的马哈的管家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's first butler to the Maharajah of Miranjapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.20,0:32:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是米兰加泊是流动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Miranjapore is a floating court.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.37,0:32:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会在印度各个不同的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It travels through India.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.37,0:32:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得妈妈那时候有很多的明信片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember Mom getting postcards.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.37,0:32:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说威尔福来德是很难找到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Wilfred can be rather difficult to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.87,0:32:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们不可能在大象身上还有传真机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose they have fax machines on elephants.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.92,0:32:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想尽办法跟他联系 可惜都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying to reach him with no success.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.26,0:32:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,当一个人开始老去 他就更渴望拥有家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}When one grows ancient, one yearns for family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.55,0:32:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在床头也有这张妈妈的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the same picture of Mom by my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.72,0:32:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩格？？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peg?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.93,0:32:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是我给玛格丽特起的小名\N{\fnArial\fs30}My nickname for sweet Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.27,0:32:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,能重新见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.28,0:32:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.53,0:32:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很想你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.74,0:32:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好去睡觉吧 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep well, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.53,0:33:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.16,0:33:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,去睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.98,0:34:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 哥谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.48,0:34:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是闲话麦片节目向你早间报导 直接从哥谭气象站发来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Gossip Gerty reporting to you direct from the Gotham Observatory…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.49,0:34:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,亿万富翁布鲁斯韦恩先生 韦恩娱乐公司的总裁以及慈善家\N{\fnArial\fs30}… where billionaire Bruce Wayne, chairman of Wayne Enterprises…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.20,0:34:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有意将另一个传奇的捐赠给哥谭镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}… is about to make yet another legendary contribution to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.33,0:34:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥谭天文台 祸害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotham Observatory, Bane.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.37,0:34:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,踩油门\N{\fnArial\fs30}And step on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.04,0:34:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,踩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.18,0:34:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸曾经跟我说过「想要成功 我们只需要挑中一个明星 跟着他就好 」\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father told me, "To succeed, we need only pick a star and follow it."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.68,0:34:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以韦恩娱乐就把世界上最先进的望远镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Wayne Enterprises is donating the world's most advanced telescope…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.06,0:34:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,捐给哥谭镇气象站 让他们去完成那个修复计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Gotham 's Observatory Restoration Project.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.40,0:34:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果运气好的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}With any luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.94,0:34:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个望远镜能够给我们的下一代\N{\fnArial\fs30}this telescope will give future generations a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.03,0:35:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,更好的机会去观察星星\N{\fnArial\fs30}to follow their own stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.41,0:35:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brucy…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.66,0:35:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个望远镜真的可以看到整个星球嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it true that this new telescope can see around the globe?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.83,0:35:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 只要你看着这些银幕 Lee博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. If you'll watch these monitors right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.54,0:35:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星已经进入轨道 在星球周围的每一个点上反射光线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satellites in orbit allow us to reflect light from anywhere on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.72,0:35:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以在地球的每一处看到天空\N{\fnArial\fs30}From here, we'll be able to see the sky anywhere on Earth…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.26,0:35:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是通过用这个复杂的卫星网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}and through this intricate network of satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.22,0:35:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,来把它反射到我们自己的哥谭镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}…reflect it back to our very own Gotham City for observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.39,0:35:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是不要把他对准我的卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't point it at my bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.28,0:35:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 您和优雅的朱莉迈迪森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brucy, you and the exquisite Julie Madison.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.28,0:35:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}…have been going out forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.07,0:35:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会真正把事情落实下来嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to tie the knot?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.45,0:35:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊结婚啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.45,0:35:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,结婚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.58,0:35:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意帮我这个忙嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to give me a hand here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.41,0:35:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯和我正在激烈的热恋中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce and I are recklessly in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.75,0:35:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这个 很明显 我们已经很满足 至少是现在很满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's most certainly enough for us for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.49,0:35:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.92,0:36:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我过来 我告诉你哪个是中心控制杆\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you will follow me, I'll show you the central control grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.30,0:36:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真帮了我一个大忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a lot of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.72,0:36:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 你站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss, you need to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.30,0:36:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挡着我的路 你们这些法西斯主义走狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, fascist bulldog!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.72,0:36:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果要见伟恩先生的话你一定要预约 - 不 我不需要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need an appointment… - No, I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.14,0:36:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 你没有权力到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss, you're not authorized to be up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.27,0:36:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 她连通行证都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has no pass, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.60,0:36:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会伤害到我的 不是吗？小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little overly protective, but you won't hurt me, Miss…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.61,0:36:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我 帕美拉埃斯里博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Pamela Isley.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.44,0:36:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.94,0:36:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能够为你作些什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.78,0:36:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我为你工作 或者说 曾经为你工作过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I already work for you, or did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.16,0:36:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知你还记得那个在南美进行的乔木保存的项目吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your arboreal preservation project in South America?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.49,0:36:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们减少了经费 因为我们在观念上有了分歧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cut our funding. There was a conflict of ideologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.79,0:36:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Woodrue博士是一个彻头彻尾的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Woodrue was a lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.62,0:36:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.00,0:36:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 那个实验室在上个星期被烧成一片废墟 我很高兴你能逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. That lab burnt down last week. I'm glad you escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.30,0:36:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里有一份关于如何让韦恩娱乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have here a proposal showing how Wayne Enterprises can immediately…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.63,0:36:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止所有毒害我们环境的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}…cease all actions that toxify our environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.80,0:36:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘掉那些星星吧 仔细看看我们的地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the stars, look here at the earth…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.35,0:36:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的母亲 我们的发源地\N{\fnArial\fs30}…our mother, our womb.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.14,0:36:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她才真正值得我们去关心去保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}She deserves your loyalty and protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.15,0:36:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 你们却损害了她的土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, you spoil her lands…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.65,0:36:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒害海洋\N{\fnArial\fs30}poison her oceans,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.15,0:37:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,污染天空\N{\fnArial\fs30}blacken her skies!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.48,0:37:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们正在把她杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're killing her!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.36,0:37:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你的目的非常的高尚 可是如果没有柴油机和燃料来发热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your intentions are noble, but no diesel fuel for heat…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.49,0:37:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有冷冻剂来帮助贮藏食物 数百万的人就会死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}no coolants to preserve food, millions of people would die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.54,0:37:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这个是可以接受的 尤其是在这一场拯救星球的战役中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acceptable losses in the battle to save the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.12,0:37:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isley博士人类才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People come first, Dr Isley.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.50,0:37:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哺乳动物就是这样！！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mammals!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.51,0:37:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天老天会找你们算帐的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A day of reckoning is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.67,0:37:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.97,0:37:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些看着你们植物和花朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same plants and flowers that saw you…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.76,0:37:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是从原始泥塘中爬行出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}crawl from the primordial soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.97,0:37:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天要从你们手里收回这个星球 什么都保护不了你们 ！\N{\fnArial\fs30}will reclaim this planet and there will be no one to protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.36,0:37:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是新来的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be new in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.69,0:37:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你都不知道在哥谭镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Gotham City.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.82,0:37:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是蝙蝠侠和洛宾在保护我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batman and Robin protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.36,0:37:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕是植物和花朵要侵犯我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even from plants and flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.37,0:37:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你想认识认识他们？博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you'd like to meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.83,0:37:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些戴帽子的十字军也会帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caped crusaders are going to help us auction…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.46,0:37:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那些钻石高价拍卖出去 建设我们的植物园了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a diamond to raise money for our botanical gardens.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.71,0:38:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有少数的哺乳动物才会力所能及的 为这个世界上的植物做一点事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a few mammals doing what we can for the world's plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.21,0:38:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你们的到来表示深切的谢意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you all for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.84,0:38:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士也祝你有美好的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day, Doctor.!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.56,0:38:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠和洛宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batman and Robin…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.23,0:38:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,热血动物压迫者的爪牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}…militant arm of the warm-blooded oppressors…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.48,0:38:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持现状的动物保护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}…animal protectors of the status quo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.24,0:38:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}First.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.87,0:38:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把自己从这些长着皮毛的害虫里摆脱出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll rid myself of the fur and feathered pests.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.75,0:38:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后整个哥谭镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.04,0:38:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.75,0:38:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一片绿色\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the greening.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.81,0:39:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.27,0:39:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这有些东西你应该会觉得有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something here you might want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.82,0:39:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌我在看这个片子的时候别人打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate when people talk during the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.93,0:39:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,再要一个钻石 我的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more diamond, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.10,0:39:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,再要一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.11,0:39:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯韦恩钻石 恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Bruce Wayne. Diamonds."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.82,0:39:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.99,0:40:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.96,0:40:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,早间节目的闲聊麦片\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Gossip Gerty of "Good Morning Gotham" and I…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.88,0:40:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你们来到黑夜珍宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}…welcome you to the gem of the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.17,0:40:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的哥登专员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our own Commissioner Gordon…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.01,0:40:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为大家展示\N{\fnArial\fs30}…displaying…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.51,0:40:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件著名的彩虹女神之心\N{\fnArial\fs30}the famed Heart of Isis, on loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.10,0:41:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来自我一位亲密友人的私人收藏 这个人就是布鲁斯韦恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the collection of my close personal friend, Bruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.90,0:41:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得急冻人会上钩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think Freeze will take the bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.94,0:41:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.11,0:41:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们这儿其中最美丽的一朵花跳起舞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to dance with one of our fabulous flowers…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.94,0:41:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那颗著名的钻石就佩戴在她的脖子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}the famed diamond draped around her neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.20,0:41:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们开始竞价吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's start the bidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.41,0:41:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给兰花出10万元\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give 10, 000 for the orchid!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.27,0:41:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.04,0:41:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给百合出20万元\N{\fnArial\fs30}20, 000 for the tiger lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.78,0:41:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.42,0:41:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I bid…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.76,0:41:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那朵可爱的木兰出30万元 ！\N{\fnArial\fs30}30, 000 dollars for the lovely magnolia!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.97,0:41:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys, please…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.98,0:41:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们表露出我们有多么的欢畅\N{\fnArial\fs30}…let's show some gusto!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.41,0:42:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wo!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.18,0:43:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wo!!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.90,0:43:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.90,0:43:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问你是？？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.48,0:43:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒药！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poison…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.36,0:44:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有毒的常春藤\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Poison Ivy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.50,0:44:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不把这个年轻人早些送回家去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not send junior home early?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.63,0:44:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这儿有更多更野性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got some wild oats to sow.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.59,0:44:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.72,0:44:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的确是有优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}…youth does have its advantages.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.26,0:44:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍耐力 持久力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Endurance, stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.43,0:44:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那只衰老的蝙蝠忘掉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the geriatric Bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.10,0:44:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,来跟我在一起吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.85,0:44:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的花园需要有人来管理\N{\fnArial\fs30}My garden needs tending.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.61,0:44:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要在这儿选个人 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take it from here, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.23,0:44:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你 也喜欢这项链吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't you like the earrings too?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.24,0:44:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些幸运的人将会打中这个蜜糖罐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some lucky boy's about to hit the honey pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.87,0:44:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会和我另一个同伴和胜出者共度这个夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll include an evening of my company for the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.62,0:44:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带上所有你在这儿见过的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring everything you see here…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.17,0:44:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及 你没见过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…plus everything you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.34,0:45:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给她出价五万美金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bid 50, 000 dollars for Poison Ivy!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.09,0:45:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出10万 ！\N{\fnArial\fs30}100, 000!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.64,0:45:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我出\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll bid…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.06,0:45:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,50万 ！\N{\fnArial\fs30}500, 000 dollars!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.14,0:45:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出一百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}One million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.94,0:45:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我出两百万 - 你根本没有钱 我出三百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 2 million. - You don't have it. 3 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.36,0:45:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以从你那儿借 四百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll borrow it from you Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.11,0:45:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,五百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}5 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.15,0:45:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个有用的腰带 不是钱带\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a utility belt, not a money belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.99,0:45:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,六百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}6 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.16,0:45:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,七百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}7 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.62,0:45:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,从不放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never leave the cave without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.37,0:45:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩该不会为了我 打起来了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys aren't going to start fighting over little old me, now are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.60,0:45:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 各位 冷冻！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everyone! Chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.14,0:45:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷冻！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.32,0:46:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿上枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.32,0:46:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！看看你们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.16,0:46:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.66,0:46:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,植物女？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plant Girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.29,0:46:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,蔓藤女士是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vine Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.83,0:46:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钻石递过来 花园女郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand over the diamond, Garden Gal…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.25,0:47:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就把你用冰封起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or I'll turn you into mulch.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.09,0:47:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,生化粉尘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pheromone dust…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.55,0:47:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,专门为\N{\fnArial\fs30}designed to heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.01,0:47:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人的血液而设计的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a man's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.85,0:47:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是对我急冻人是没用的 请给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't work on the cold-hearted. If you please!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.27,0:47:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你一定坚持要\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you insist,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.85,0:47:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明的三叶草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clever little clover.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.40,0:47:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my exit cue.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.03,0:47:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.71,0:47:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.96,0:47:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,错的派对！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool party!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.12,0:48:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,专员 你有11分钟的时间来给这些人解冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commissioner, you have 11 minutes to thaw these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.84,0:48:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 你刚刚遇到了哥谭最险恶的人之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Ivy, you've just met one of the most sinister men in Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.17,0:48:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他根本就不是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a man…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.34,0:48:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是神\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that is a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.47,0:48:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用在装扮成猩猩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough monkey business,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.27,0:48:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有更重要的事情要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.36,0:48:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey work.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.70,0:49:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,刹车 你根本不可能跳过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't make the jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.28,0:49:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能跳过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.16,0:49:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,刹车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull back!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.37,0:49:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能跳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.62,0:49:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,红雀控制代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redbird control codes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.21,0:49:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disable engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.42,0:49:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能对我这样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it to me!!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.98,0:49:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.93,0:50:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这样不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.25,0:50:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个冰冷的城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cold town.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.78,0:51:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来一定可以跳过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've made that jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.58,0:51:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来已经把你的脑浆泼溅在那座大楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've splattered your brains on the building's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.54,0:51:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在马戏团 大家都是团队工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Flying Graysons were a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.50,0:51:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须信任每一个人才能完成我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to trust each to do his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.58,0:51:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样才是成为拍档的真正涵义\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what being partners is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.84,0:51:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些时候 只有跟其他人合作才是你的唯一生路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Counting on someone is the way to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.46,0:51:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那个时候满脑子想的都是那个毒药爱维\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your head wasn't on the job. It was on Poison Ivy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.34,0:51:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是无法忍受她喜欢我而不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she wanted me instead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.72,0:51:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你所谓的友谊是吗 布鲁斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your idea of friendship?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.64,0:51:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的房子 你的规则 你的方式？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your rules. It's your way, or the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.51,0:51:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远都是蝙蝠侠和洛宾 而不是洛宾和蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Batman and Robin, not Robin and Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.35,0:51:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很讨厌它！- 没错 我的规则让我们大家都活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sick of it! - Yes it's my rules that keep us alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.69,0:51:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且如果你要留在这个房子里 成为这个团队的一员 你就必须遵守这些规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to stay in this house, on this team, you'll abide by them.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.23,0:51:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根本就不是拍档\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no partnership.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.03,0:51:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也永远都不会相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never going to trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.37,0:51:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的Welfred哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear brother Wilfred…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.66,0:51:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尝试各种办法找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I have tried every address I know for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.71,0:51:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在只能祈祷这个或许能够和你取得联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just praying this reaches you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.05,0:51:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的时间都不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have very little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.04,0:52:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.11,0:52:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠简直独占了晚间新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batman monopolized the evening news.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.04,0:52:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.86,0:52:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你终于抓住了急冻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations on your apprehension of Mr Freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.65,0:52:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.74,0:52:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不对劲么 先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there something wrong, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.58,0:52:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alfred 我是一个很顽固的人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I pig-headed,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.68,0:52:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.88,0:52:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it always.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.59,0:52:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是强用我自己的方式？\N{\fnArial\fs30}my way or the highway?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.05,0:52:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么问？不过 实际上就是那么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, yes. Actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.88,0:52:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡和偶然抢走了你的双亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death and chance stole your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.89,0:52:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你没有成为牺牲品\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but rather than become a victim…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.18,0:52:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经做了你能做到的一切 来掌握命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you have done everything in your power to control the fates.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.73,0:52:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是蝙蝠侠努力要\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what is Batman…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.02,0:52:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌管和清理这个混乱的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}if not an effort to master the chaos that sweeps our world?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.61,0:53:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是努力去控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}An attempt to control…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.65,0:53:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}death itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.22,0:53:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我不行 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.55,0:53:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us can.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.97,0:53:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.56,0:53:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.25,0:53:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 真的很对不起！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. So sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.79,0:53:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从牛津剑桥学的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teach you that at Oxbridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.42,0:54:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一些柔道课程罢了 伦敦是个粗糙的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a few judo lessons. You know, London's kind of rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.09,0:54:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你还学习了怎么骑摩托车是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you had a minor in motorbikes also?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.89,0:54:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在没有办法抗拒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't resist!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.72,0:54:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 它实在是太漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.10,0:54:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是骑着他兜了个小圈 我明天早上把它擦干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just took it out for a spin. I'll clean it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.27,0:54:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.44,0:54:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.27,0:54:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.57,0:55:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他拉到冷冻区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drag him into the cold beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.66,0:55:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回到家来 急冻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, Frost Face.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.74,0:55:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是一般冷而已 我们来修理你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the common cold, and we are the cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.04,0:55:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我把冰打烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to break the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.88,0:55:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字叫冷冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.34,0:55:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好学会它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learn it well…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.34,0:55:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是你们毁灭时候的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for it's the chilling sound of your doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.06,0:55:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 ！急冻人 你根本就不可能在冰冻区域以外的地方生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Freezie, you can't live outside the cold zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.83,0:55:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他那个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.92,0:56:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好习惯一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.54,0:56:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会在这儿呆上好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to be here a very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.63,0:56:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,日子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.80,0:56:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.55,0:56:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们根本不可能活着见到\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will not live to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.71,0:56:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.81,0:56:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠脸 鸟雀的脑子 好像对我的药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batface and Birdbrain turned out to be much more resistant…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.61,0:56:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,比想象中更有抵抗力\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to my love dust than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.15,0:56:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧 下一次 我只需要给他们更强的剂量就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter. Next time I'll just give them a stronger dose.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.41,0:56:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上他们能为了我去死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll literally be dying for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.45,0:56:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,土耳其沐浴\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Turkish baths."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.83,0:56:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个看起来有前途\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.03,0:57:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很乱嘛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fixer-upper!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.57,0:57:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过还算有一种家庭式的吸引力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with a certain homey charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.37,0:57:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,少算了一个！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A minus!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.95,0:57:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的住客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Current tenants.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.87,0:57:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我的小美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, my little pretty, pretty, pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.00,0:57:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.42,0:57:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来味道不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look good enough to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.67,0:57:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.01,0:57:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来抓我吧 如果你能行的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get me, if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.68,0:57:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.74,0:57:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们重新把这儿装修一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's redecorate.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.50,0:58:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都想要点水上的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always hankered for something on the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.22,0:58:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,地上是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.52,0:58:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝花了七天时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took God seven days.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.78,0:58:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}to create Paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.44,0:58:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我能不能做得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if I can do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.62,0:58:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.08,0:58:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快为妈咪长大吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grow for mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.17,0:58:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bane 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane, darling…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.88,0:58:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现一个能实现我梦想的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I found a fellow who strikes my fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.47,0:59:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷酷的家伙 确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cool customer, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.72,0:59:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰冷无情的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Icy demeanor…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.18,0:59:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.56,0:59:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我发现一种残忍的魅力 也许我可以利用它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I detect a certain ruthless charm I may be able to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.48,0:59:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去提高我的优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}to my advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.28,0:59:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 把这清理一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, clean up this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.03,0:59:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去把伙伴找来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got company coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.86,0:59:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.49,0:59:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.18,0:59:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.52,0:59:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.02,0:59:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布鲁斯？- 嗯哼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bruce? - Mm-hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.05,0:59:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一起已经一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been going out for over a year now, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.84,0:59:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 直说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.35,0:59:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,今后的日子我想和你一起度过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to spend my life with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.85,0:59:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Julie 我不是合适的结婚对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the marrying kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.85,0:59:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些关于我的事情你无法理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things about me you wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.31,0:59:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你一直是个单身汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're a dedicated bachelor.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.28,0:59:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你有过很多疯狂的夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've had your wild nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.44,0:59:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂并不\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Wild" doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.78,1:00:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不足以形容这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}…quite cover it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.87,1:00:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天你会找到一个好丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll make someone a good husband one day,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.70,1:00:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不想一直等下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can't wait forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.29,1:00:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 我不想给你压力 因为如果我逼你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't want to pressure you. Because if I do…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.21,1:00:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会拒绝我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll just shut down.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.71,1:00:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解你的性格\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the way you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.88,1:00:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.89,1:00:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我你会考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just promise me you'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.97,1:00:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.35,1:00:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必现在回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to answer now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.48,1:00:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.73,1:00:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}think it over.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.27,1:00:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你思考的动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's food for thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.00,1:00:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是lvy？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Ivy?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.56,1:00:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩？什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm? What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.55,1:00:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才叫我lvy\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just called me "Ivy."
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.59,1:01:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是lvy？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Ivy?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.13,1:01:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.68,1:01:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,放大细节 14到19\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enhance detail, 14 to 19.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.31,1:01:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.95,1:01:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.02,1:02:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见！\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.17,1:02:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌多少硬币？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey Banker, how much coin to play?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.00,1:02:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个半\N{\fnArial\fs30}2 and 1/2.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.30,1:02:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是两天前赢了隧道赛的菜鸟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the chick who won the tunnel run 2 nights ago!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.42,1:02:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'd be me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.68,1:02:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？那只是小孩子的玩意 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was kid stuff, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.26,1:02:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你不带上你的小三轮车滚回家去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take your tricycle and run home?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.18,1:02:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赌一把？- 赌多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Want a side bet? - How much?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.14,1:02:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要赌多少？- 你要赌多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much you got? - How much you got?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.02,1:02:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 准备比赛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's race! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.20,1:02:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看他们在桥那头准备好没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just make sure the guys are ready at the end of the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.70,1:02:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会赢的 Spike！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it, Spike!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.60,1:03:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.15,1:03:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲！冲！冲啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!Go!Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.20,1:03:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你的左边！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch you left!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.40,1:04:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挡我的路 窝囊废！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of my way losers!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.57,1:04:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的不错 小姑娘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try, girlie!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.03,1:04:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个就是你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're next!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.32,1:04:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.37,1:04:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 宝贝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.85,1:04:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于一只菜鸟来说还不错！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad for a chick!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.43,1:05:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.86,1:05:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,终点到了 甜心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of the line, sweetheart!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.89,1:05:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你挂住的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is where you hang out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.06,1:06:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赛车有多久了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you been racing?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.48,1:06:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我父母去世时起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since my parents died.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.69,1:06:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为速度和危险 能让我自己从\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess all the speed and danger helped take me out of myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.90,1:06:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛苦中解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made the pain go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.23,1:06:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.07,1:06:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真让我惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.91,1:06:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,街头赛车在牛津和剑桥 是无法接受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Street racing isn't exactly an acceptable major at Oxbridge so…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.70,1:06:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我被退学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they kicked me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.45,1:06:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不要紧 因为我已经赢够了我需要的钱 能够让我去实现自己的梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've already won the money I need to do what I've always dreamed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.33,1:06:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要告诉我你想出走去参加马戏团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say you want to join the circus.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.42,1:06:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alfred 一直在支持我 我要回报他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred has supported me my whole life and I'm going to pay him back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.38,1:06:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要帮他脱离这种为人仆役的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take him away from this dismal life of servitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.89,1:06:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.55,1:06:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这种主仆关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, this whole master-servant thing…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.52,1:06:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在是荒谬透顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's really ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.14,1:06:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alfred是世上最可爱 最有风度的绅士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred is a sweet, noble man…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.56,1:06:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他却要屈从于他的生活 他也梦想能象别人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and he's subjugated all his life and dreams to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.31,1:06:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alfred和Bruce就象一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred and Bruce are like family.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.40,1:06:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,雇人帮你做饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paying someone to prepare your meals…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.74,1:06:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你洗衣服洗碗 你说这是一家人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…do laundry, clean dishes, you call that family?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.91,1:06:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alfred很乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred's happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.57,1:07:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.62,1:07:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你真的不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You honestly don't know, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.20,1:07:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他一直以来是怎样隐瞒自己的痛苦吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How he's hiding the pain all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.46,1:07:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alfred病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred's sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.38,1:07:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alfred没病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred's not sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.59,1:07:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.68,1:07:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dying?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.27,1:07:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他不告诉我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't he tell us?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.31,1:07:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解Alfred 他从不说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Alfred, he'd never say anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.28,1:07:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我能看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.57,1:07:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.79,1:07:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.50,1:08:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰人 你有个客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Icehead, you got a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.80,1:08:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹妹来看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister is here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.38,1:08:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,妹妹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.76,1:08:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, dear…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.35,1:08:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你很忧郁\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I heard you were blue.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.85,1:08:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要介意我们 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mind us, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.40,1:08:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以畅所欲言\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can speak freely.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.07,1:09:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本就不介意你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mind you at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.53,1:09:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.12,1:09:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝最可笑的创造\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most absurd of God's creatures.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.08,1:09:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赐予你们生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We give you life…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.08,1:09:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也能同样轻易的夺走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we can take it away just as easily.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.67,1:09:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对！- 无论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right! - Whatever,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.30,1:09:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really am to die for.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.70,1:09:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让我感动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressive!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.46,1:09:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最可爱的雪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I, my most unabominable snowman…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.29,1:09:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经被你打动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…have been impressed by you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.88,1:09:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.46,1:10:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议我们结成一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I propose a pairing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.06,1:10:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来救你出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come to set you free.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.10,1:10:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个诱人的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}An enticing offer,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.61,1:10:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.77,1:10:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位小姐想得到什么回报呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what does the lady want in return?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.74,1:10:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把这个放一边 有个人我希望你见见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's cool it for now. I've got someone I want you to meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.62,1:10:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫Bane\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Bane.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.50,1:10:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗衣店把衣服送来了！喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A laundry service that delivers! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.63,1:10:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么尺寸 50 码的大小？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, about a 50, big and tall?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.93,1:10:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我一般穿小点的 这让我看起来苗条些\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I always go a size smaller. Makes me look slimmer.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.40,1:10:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的能量快用完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm running on empty.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.15,1:11:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去我藏身的地方拿钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.82,1:11:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你夺回你的钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll help you grab your rocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.36,1:11:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bane！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.66,1:11:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.16,1:11:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄个出口 求你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}an exit, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.54,1:11:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,加固的钢铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reinforced steel.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.50,1:11:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.51,1:11:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要给水管装上防冻设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always winterize your pipes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.99,1:11:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿钻石 你和Meatloaf去救我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I get my diamonds, you and "meatloaf" retrieve my wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.20,1:11:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没说过你有妻子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never mentioned a wife!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.41,1:11:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.58,1:11:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望Bane先生会游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope Mr Bane can swim.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.93,1:12:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alfred 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred are you well?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.27,1:12:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好得不能再好了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}As well as can be expected, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.90,1:12:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友 我知道你病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend, I know you're sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.65,1:12:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你找了最好的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get you the best doctors.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.65,1:12:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经去找过最好的医生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have seen the best doctors.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.78,1:12:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个绅士不会喋喋不休讲他的疾病那不礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gentleman does not discuss his ailments. It is not civilized.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.91,1:12:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我至少教过你这些 Bruce少爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope that I have taught you at least that much, Master Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.58,1:12:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.50,1:12:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.13,1:12:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,遗憾过在这工作吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…regretted your life working here?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.47,1:12:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾英雄？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking after heroes?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.09,1:12:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.35,1:12:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一的遗憾就是我永远不能 和你一起出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}My only regret is that I was never able to be out there with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.98,1:13:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是所有的英雄都戴着面具的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all the heroes wear masks.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.61,1:13:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰冻人跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze has escaped!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.67,1:13:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们从Arkham的监视器上取下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got this off the Arkham surveillance camera.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.51,1:13:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒藤女lvy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poison Ivy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.51,1:13:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天前\N{\fnArial\fs30}2 nights ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.76,1:13:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥谭机场这两人从南美包机来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Gotham Airport, these two arrive by charter from South America.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.14,1:13:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们打伤了10名保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}They put 10 security guards in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.35,1:13:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还用有机毒药杀死了一个商人 并偷了他的豪华轿车\N{\fnArial\fs30}…left a businessman dead from organic poisoning, stole his limousine.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.06,1:13:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,明显是这两人干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is definitely the same pair that sprang Freeze.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.57,1:13:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪了，先生们.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.90,1:13:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒藤女lvy 为什么她要帮冰冻人逃跑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poison Ivy, why would she help Freeze?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.57,1:13:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她确实很邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's definitely evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.37,1:13:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是让人难以置信 我曾经为她神魂颠倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was all I could think about, like I was in love…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.37,1:14:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解 然后这种感觉突然消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, then the feeling vanished.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.71,1:14:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以相信我们要迎战一个坏家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe we fought over a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.21,1:14:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏是坏 家伙却不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad, yes. Guy, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.75,1:14:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经完全摆脱她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm totally over her.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.71,1:14:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too. Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.38,1:14:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 虽然着迷比较深 - 我也是.\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great stems, though. - Buds too.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.72,1:14:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.89,1:14:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.18,1:14:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是Nora Fries\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Nora Fries.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.56,1:14:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.91,1:14:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他采用他的冰冻技术来延缓Macgregor综合症\N{\fnArial\fs30}He adapted his freezing technology to reverse the disease.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.91,1:14:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经找到了治疗这种病某些时期的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found a cure for the disease in some stages.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.58,1:14:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.88,1:14:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去拿钻石 我去救你的白雪公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the diamonds, I'll rescue the bride.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.46,1:14:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我那里碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll meet back at my place.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.43,1:14:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我现在太虚弱了 打不过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my weakened condition. I'm no match for the Bat and Bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.93,1:15:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来搞定这些家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave those boys to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.93,1:15:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.48,1:15:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他能救她吗？- 她的病已经到晚期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can he save her? - Her case is too advanced.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.44,1:15:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也许有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe someday…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.94,1:15:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过更多的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}with more research.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.07,1:15:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒藤女lvy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poison Ivy,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.58,1:15:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌不速之客\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate uninvited guests.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.22,1:15:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的肺！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lungs!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.93,1:15:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的肺冻住了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lungs are freezing!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.44,1:15:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美的冰冻！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chilled to perfection!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.85,1:15:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.04,1:16:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有美女！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No beauty!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.00,1:16:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the beast.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.52,1:16:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 可爱的小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there, pretty birdie.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.77,1:16:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,投降吧 如果你投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give yourself up. If you surrender…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.90,1:16:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.03,1:16:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,想来个吻吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polly want a kiss?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.37,1:16:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位穿着结构完美的橡皮衣的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something about an anatomically correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.96,1:16:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是让一个女孩忍不住要去吻一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}rubber suit that puts fire in a girl's lips.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.39,1:17:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么外表美丽的人都心如蛇蝎？说我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are all the gorgeous ones homicidal maniacs? Is it me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.06,1:17:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜言蜜语已经说够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough sweet talk!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.73,1:17:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 你要告诉我冰冻人在哪里 然后你将被关进监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}First you'll tell me where Freeze is, then you're going to jail.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.36,1:17:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个情人 可不是一个战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a lover, not a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.07,1:17:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以每次毒藤女lvy行动都要带上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why every Poison Ivy Action Figure comes with him!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.91,1:17:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死的时候可不要屁滚尿流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try not to make a mess when you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.07,1:18:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的！是的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.78,1:18:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.63,1:18:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.26,1:18:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,活在那只大蝙蝠的阴影之下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living in the shadow of the big, bad Bat.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.14,1:18:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.81,1:18:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是明星\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the star.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.15,1:18:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就能看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see it now:
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.15,1:18:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在天空中有一个又大又明亮的标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your own big, bright signal in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.15,1:18:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来指引你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guide you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.83,1:18:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我吻你一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me kiss you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.83,1:18:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来！不要吻她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!Don't kiss her!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.00,1:19:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,机场的受害者 就是由嘴唇中毒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The victim at the airport, toxins introduced orally.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.05,1:19:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么？- 她为什么想吻我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you saying? - Why does she want to kiss us?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.88,1:19:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我敢说她的嘴有毒 - 毒吻？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I bet her lips are poisoned - Poisoned kiss?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.47,1:19:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对女人的看法有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have issues with women!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.05,1:19:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能忍受她吻我而不是吻你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stand that she'd kiss me and not you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.72,1:19:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能忍受有东西属于我却不属于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something would be mine, not yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.32,1:19:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去吧 Bane\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exit, Bane.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.82,1:19:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exit!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.42,1:19:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,lvy是对的 我不需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ivy's right. I don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.21,1:19:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以后独来独往\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going solo!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.51,1:19:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.84,1:19:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么逃跑了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd they get away?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.95,1:20:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来都不擅长竞争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been good with competition.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.95,1:20:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会需要一个冰冷的妻子呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who needs a frigid wife anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.10,1:20:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该在场就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make yourself right at home.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.40,1:20:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my wife?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.07,1:20:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无能为力 蝙蝠侠拔了她的装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nothing I could do, Batman deactivated her.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.57,1:20:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她死了 - 你撒谎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's dead - You lie!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.60,1:21:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.44,1:21:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要他们的骨头都变成冰！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their bones will turn to ice!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.48,1:21:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要亲手把他们的血冻住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their blood will freeze in my hands!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.03,1:21:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然要杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.61,1:21:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就仅此而已吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why stop there?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.16,1:21:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么只有蝙蝠侠和罗宾死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should only Batman and Robin die,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.16,1:21:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,而创造他们的人类社会却不受惩罚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}while the society that created them goes unpunished?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.79,1:21:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.67,1:21:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要承受痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I must suffer…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.04,1:21:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么人类也要和我一起痛苦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}…humanity will suffer with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.17,1:21:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会报复他们的 因为他们让我过着感受不到人间温暖的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall repay them for sentencing me to a life without human comfort.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.64,1:21:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让这个城市笼罩在无尽的冬天之下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will blanket the city in endless winter!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.35,1:21:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}First…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.02,1:22:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哥谭镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.35,1:22:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.35,1:22:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是全世界！\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.90,1:22:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也正是我想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just what I had in mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.99,1:22:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我们地球上的一切都要灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything dead on Earth, except us!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.36,1:22:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chance for.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.07,1:22:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,让自然母亲重生的契机\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Mother Nature to start again.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.24,1:22:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.37,1:22:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个新纪元的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dawn of a new age.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.54,1:22:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的植物们拥有致命野兽的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mutant plants have the strength of the deadliest animals.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.55,1:22:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你将人类冰冻 这些孩子就会遍布整个星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you have frozen mankind, these babies will overrun the globe.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.93,1:22:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们将统治它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we shall rule them.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.39,1:22:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}For we will be…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.10,1:22:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界上仅存的两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the only two people left in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.52,1:22:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.56,1:22:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.40,1:22:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,和夏娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.40,1:22:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去吸引蝙蝠们的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You distract the Bat and Bird…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.53,1:22:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}…while I prepare…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.28,1:22:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}to freeze.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.87,1:22:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥谭镇的时候！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotham!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.71,1:23:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经到了Macgregor综合症的某个阶段了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Stage 1 of Macgregor's Syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.43,1:23:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.68,1:23:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所能做的就是让他舒服点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we can do is make him comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.06,1:23:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.70,1:23:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Macgregor综合症 Fries的妻子也是这种病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Macgregor's Syndrome is what Fries' wife had.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.83,1:23:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 Alfred的情况还没那么糟糕 Fries的研究提过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred's condition is less severe, Fries' research said.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.71,1:23:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经治好过一个类似Alfred的病人 只是没有说如何治好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he cured a case like it, just didn't say how.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.34,1:23:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查过数据库 没有类似的.\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one else is even close.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.42,1:23:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去参加捐赠仪式了 然后我会独自去找冰冻人和lvy\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm late for the dedication, then I go after Freeze and Ivy alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.26,1:23:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就象你平时那样 - 不要马上就责怪我.\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like hell you do. - Don't push me right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.72,1:24:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？除了蝙蝠就没人能抓住lvy了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what? No one can capture Ivy but the big bad Bat?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.18,1:24:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.47,1:24:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是为了自己才想抓她的 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want her for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.18,1:24:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓她是因为她很坏 我能感觉到 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want her so badly, I can taste it. That's the whole point.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.54,1:24:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 ！你和我本都是完美的楷模\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! You and I are perfect target.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.15,1:24:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定在我们身上做了手脚 不知何故会为她争斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's done something to us. She has us fighting over her somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.28,1:24:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她爱我而不是你 这让你发疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know she loves me and not you, and it's driving you crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.95,1:24:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要阻止我们接吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you stopped us from kissing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.49,1:24:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你无法正确思考了 - 但我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not thinking straight. - But I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.29,1:24:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始 以后也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time in a long time,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.46,1:24:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要在天空中有Robin的标志 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a Robin signal in the sky, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.13,1:24:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我厌倦了活在你的阴影下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of living in your shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.29,1:24:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在一切结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that ends now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.59,1:24:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.68,1:24:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.78,1:24:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你一定要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You You must.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.23,1:24:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要为我做件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must do something for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.07,1:25:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到我的兄弟Wilfred\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find my brother, Wilfred…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.24,1:25:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的叔叔 无论他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your uncle, wherever he is, and give him…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.99,1:25:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.24,1:25:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要代替我来完成我的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have duties that he must fulfill in my stead.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.42,1:25:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有亲人可以信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only family can be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.79,1:25:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.55,1:25:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是两个优秀男人对我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a sacred trust of two good men,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.17,1:25:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,神圣的信任 我可以荣幸地称他们为儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}whom I have the honor of calling "son "
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.18,1:25:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个带给Wilfred\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it to Wilfred…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.64,1:25:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恳求你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I implore you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.18,1:25:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不要打开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}…never open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.06,1:25:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来真象你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look so like your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.65,1:25:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bonsoir 亲爱的哥谭市民们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonsoir, glamorous Gothamites.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.66,1:25:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一位来到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone who 's anyone…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.74,1:25:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥谭市天文台的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has flocked to the observatory…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.66,1:25:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这星光灿烂的夜晚将要举行天文望远镜的捐赠仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and tonight's star-studded dedication of the new telescope.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.67,1:26:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位就是捐赠者本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here's the man of the hour himself…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.38,1:26:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bruce Wayne！\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Bruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.73,1:26:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wayne先生 您有什么要说的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Wayne, how about say something?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.44,1:26:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wayne先生 这边！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Wayne, this way!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.06,1:26:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.24,1:26:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿 Wayne先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}LooK here, Mr Wayne!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.60,1:26:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commissioner.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.77,1:26:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？- 不错 你认识的 Julie\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you? - Good. You know Julie?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.48,1:26:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Julie 你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.94,1:26:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.61,1:26:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young man,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.57,1:26:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴又见到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.53,1:26:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.33,1:26:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gordon局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commissioner Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.50,1:26:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I've always wondered…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.42,1:26:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只大蝙蝠的灯光是从哪来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where does that big, old Batlight come from?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.09,1:26:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.64,1:26:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就在\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.64,1:26:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察局大楼的楼顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on top of Police Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.72,1:26:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd just.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.18,1:26:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,想去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}love to see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.98,1:26:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也许你没法进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you probably don't have access.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.65,1:26:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 亲爱的小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, dear lady…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.98,1:27:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是警察局的局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I am the police commissioner.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.61,1:27:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有钥匙 就在我的口袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the keys right here in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.74,1:27:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去看看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to see it?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.84,1:27:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 亲爱的小姐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you, dear lady?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.68,1:27:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细想想 对我来说你实在是太老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On second thought, you're way too old for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.77,1:27:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不老\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.65,1:27:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.31,1:27:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.66,1:27:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在作什么？来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.49,1:27:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我这些卫星是怎么运转的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me how the satellites work.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.34,1:28:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}First…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.59,1:28:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把哥谭变成一个冰冷的墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will turn Gotham into an icy graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.89,1:28:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.97,1:28:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把蝙蝠侠的心挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will pull Batman's heart from his body.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.18,1:28:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲手把它冰冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and feel it freeze in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.36,1:28:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.73,1:28:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 Bane\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly, Bane.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.53,1:28:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly now!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.21,1:28:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,换上那个灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let there be light.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.63,1:28:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有亲人可以信任？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only family can be trusted?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.97,1:28:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm family.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.02,1:29:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,访问被拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access denied.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.03,1:29:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,访问被拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access denied.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.80,1:29:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用我的一生与死亡做斗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spend my entire life trying to beat back death.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.14,1:29:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切我做的事 一切我能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything I've done, everything I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.31,1:29:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…capable of doing…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.78,1:29:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却无法救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't save you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.90,1:29:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡是无法打败的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no defeat in death…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.16,1:29:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bruce少爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.62,1:30:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利是捍卫我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victory comes in defending.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.79,1:30:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,认为的正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we know is right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.46,1:30:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们活着的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}…while we still live.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.16,1:30:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 老头子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.29,1:30:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.15,1:31:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,访问被拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access denied.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.23,1:31:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个该死的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}This better be one hell of a secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.91,1:31:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Margaret\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.93,1:31:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Peg\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peg.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.93,1:31:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,允许访问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access allowed.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.51,1:32:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加上天文望远镜上水晶的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The combined power of the telescope's reflecting crystals…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.84,1:32:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能够完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will complete…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.05,1:32:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的冰冻机了 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}my freezing engine.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.47,1:32:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他们告诉你什么 Bane先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what they tell you, Mr. Bane…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.52,1:32:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,手上有枪才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it is the size of your gun that counts.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.86,1:32:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为你要去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.07,1:32:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是Robin的标志 Ivy在叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a Batlight, it's a Robin signal. Ivy's calling me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.20,1:32:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫Pamela lsley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name's Pamela Isley.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.58,1:32:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定是偷了他的钥匙然后改变了标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must've stolen Gordon's keys and changed the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.58,1:32:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 为了我 为了爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did it for me, for love.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.17,1:32:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定是用某种提取的信息素感染了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She infected us with pheromones.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.25,1:32:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我中了某种魔咒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm under some kind of magic spell?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.80,1:32:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.26,1:32:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这些只是想让我疏远她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd say anything to keep her away from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.01,1:32:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己就可以占有她\N{\fnArial\fs30}To keep her for yourself,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.09,1:33:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过作为一个团队意味着要相信自己的拍档\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said being a team means trusting your partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.97,1:33:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,互相帮助才是取胜之道 你还记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, counting on someone else is the only way to win. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.02,1:33:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说要成为拍档 你说要象一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't talking about partners, but about being a family.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.48,1:33:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm asking you,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.11,1:33:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 拍档\N{\fnArial\fs30}…friend, partner…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.03,1:33:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.03,1:33:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will you trust me now?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.29,1:33:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有的水晶都放好了 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All the crystals are in place - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.51,1:33:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.97,1:33:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh 对不起 把门弄坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.73,1:33:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,派对结束了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the party over?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.06,1:33:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this nutball?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.52,1:34:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}If revenge…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.36,1:34:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用寒冷做成的一盘菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a dish best served cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.19,1:34:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么就派上你们最好的警察吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then put on your Sunday finest.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.28,1:34:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,宴会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.74,1:34:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}to feast!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.92,1:34:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.38,1:35:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,将是冰冻地狱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}…hell freezes over.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.67,1:35:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruder alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.30,1:35:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruder alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.80,1:35:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵警报 入侵警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruder alert. Identify.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.85,1:35:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alfred叔叔 是我 Barbara\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Alfred, it's me. Barbara.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.77,1:35:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我期待你能找到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expected you might find your way down here, child.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.94,1:35:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时 我将我的思维\N{\fnArial\fs30}I programmed my brain algorithms…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.52,1:35:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,输入这台蝙蝠电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}… into the Batcomputer…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.19,1:36:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造了一个仿真的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and created a virtual simulation.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.03,1:36:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要帮助蝙蝠侠和Robin\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to help Batman and Robin.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.32,1:36:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你去帮他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I anticipated you would…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.20,1:36:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以自己创造适合你的装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and took the liberty to create something in your size.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.83,1:36:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很适合我 Alfred叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit me up, Uncle Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.83,1:37:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, there.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.29,1:37:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你全身上下只有拇指是绿色的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is your thumb the only part of you that's green?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.42,1:37:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will just have to find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.92,1:37:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我们能在一起 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want us to be together, but.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.97,1:37:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想确认你是真的想找个新的爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must be serious about turning over a new leaf.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.43,1:37:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一个证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a sign.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.31,1:37:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是自然而然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about "Slippery when wet."
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.60,1:37:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.14,1:38:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me your plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.94,1:38:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,吻我 我就告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss me and I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.40,1:38:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 我就吻你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me and I'll kiss you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.78,1:38:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰冻人夺取了那台新的望远镜 把它改装成了一台巨大的冰冻枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze has taken the new telescope and turned it into a giant freezing gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.86,1:38:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要把哥谭变成一个大冰块\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's about to turn Gotham into an ice cube.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.78,1:38:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.37,1:38:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One kiss…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.79,1:38:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}my love.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.00,1:38:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了好运 ！\N{\fnArial\fs30}For luck!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.43,1:38:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕是坏运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad luck, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.10,1:38:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要死了 小Robin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to die, little Robin.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.31,1:38:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你失望 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to disappoint you, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.65,1:38:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,橡胶嘴唇对你的魔法免疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}…rubber lips are immune to your charms.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.58,1:39:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.83,1:39:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是只有你会设圈套 美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the only one who can set a trap, Venus.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.00,1:39:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.17,1:39:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的这些藤会把你碾碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}my vines have a crush on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.64,1:39:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.06,1:39:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多人要杀 没多少时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many people to kill, so little time.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.03,1:39:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会变成一堆肥料\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're about to become compost.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.41,1:39:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,用美人计来达到你的目的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using feminine wiles to get what you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.25,1:39:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,出卖你的色相？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trading on your looks?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.46,1:39:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好看看书吧 大姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read a book.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.54,1:39:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一套早就过时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That passive-aggressive number went out long ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.21,1:39:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样的菜鸟真是丢女人的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give women a bad name.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.53,1:40:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我拔掉Fries小姐的插头时说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I told Lady Fries, when I pulled her plug…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.95,1:40:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个女人的表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this is a one-woman show.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.12,1:40:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.18,1:40:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curses!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.53,1:41:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰冻人要冻住整个城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze is going to ice the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.37,1:41:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.74,1:41:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.95,1:41:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batgirl.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.20,1:41:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个称号还不坏 「蝙蝠人」或者「蝙蝠女」怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not P.C. What about Batperson or Batwoman?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.12,1:41:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 Barbara 我找到了蝙蝠洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce, it's me, Barbara. I found the Batcave.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.63,1:41:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要换锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must change the locks.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.30,1:41:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她知道了我们是谁 - 我们得杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She knows who we are. - We must kill her.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.63,1:41:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍后再杀她 我们还有事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later. We have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.19,1:41:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得弄掉一些冰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's kick some ice.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.23,1:41:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.74,1:41:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.55,1:42:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的 是的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes yes yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.24,1:43:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有不到11分钟的时间来解冻这个城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have 11 minutes to thaw the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.98,1:43:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,接住你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.15,1:43:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.79,1:43:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,防护盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shield.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.79,1:43:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.14,1:44:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要毁掉这个城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll finish off the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.52,1:44:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去干掉那两个小家伙 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill the kids, but.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.98,1:44:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠留给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}leave me the Bat.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.54,1:44:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪人的影子都看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of the snowman.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.59,1:44:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他融化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he melted.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.59,1:44:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他正在冬眠\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's just hibernating.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.57,1:45:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些加热器可以将他们解冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}These heaters will thaw them.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.74,1:45:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望你有一千万个那样的小玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you've got 10 million more of those toys.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.25,1:45:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩八分多钟了 否则他们将永远变成冰块\N{\fnArial\fs30}8 minutes and they're ice cubes forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.58,1:45:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳光可以阻止冰冻的进程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunlight could reverse the freezing process.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.42,1:45:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要五小时才会日出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunrise isn't for 5 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.04,1:45:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.75,1:45:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在刚果已经是早晨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's morning in the Congo.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.38,1:45:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们传递阳光\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll relay sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.59,1:45:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,从赤道\N{\fnArial\fs30}From below the equator.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.05,1:45:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要让卫星重新排列一分钟 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take the satellites a minute to realign, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.26,1:45:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.05,1:45:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,说该死可不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn? Damn's not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.89,1:45:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,连那些反射镜都冻住了 解冻器没法运转了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those targeting mirrors are frozen.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.72,1:45:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去设置望远镜 你们去解冻反射镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realign, you thaw the mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.54,1:46:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚已经可以预见：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight's forecast:
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.21,1:46:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰冻即将降临.\N{\fnArial\fs30}A freeze is coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.44,1:46:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.87,1:46:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.75,1:46:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是我抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.85,1:47:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是上次那个人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of those days!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.83,1:48:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,卑鄙的战士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dirty fighter!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.76,1:48:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,管子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tube!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.61,1:48:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah 蝙蝠侠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay, Batman!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.33,1:48:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.08,1:48:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰冻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Freeze.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.87,1:48:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,加热开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heat is on.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.22,1:49:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在下面没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right down there?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.64,1:49:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.67,1:49:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.73,1:49:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠 做的好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing it!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.78,1:49:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输了 冰冻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've lost, Freeze.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.24,1:49:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think not.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.61,1:50:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹已经装好了 蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bombs away, Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.64,1:50:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰冻地狱 蝙蝠侠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze in hell, Batman!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.04,1:50:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.88,1:50:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.59,1:51:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.93,1:51:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住我的绳子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab on to my belt!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.54,1:51:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 蝙蝠侠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Batman!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.42,1:51:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,要带你们一程吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need a ride?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.60,1:51:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 纽约市大部分还冻着 - 现在是午夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Most of Gotham's still frozen - It's midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.43,1:51:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,望远镜又坏了 没办法解冻城市了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Telescope's gone. There's no way to thaw the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.23,1:51:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以改变卫星的位置来解冻城市 但需要一个计算机天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}The satellites could do it, but it'd take a computer genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.44,1:51:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.15,1:52:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.37,1:52:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把它上下颠倒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have to do it upside down.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.99,1:52:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 事情不是那么简单的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men! Everything the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.16,1:52:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实很擅长这个 小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pretty good at this, little girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.83,1:52:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好了 学着点 小男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch and learn, little boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.28,1:53:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来又是美好的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say it'll be a beautiful day.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.58,1:53:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你带回Arkham Asylum\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking you back to Arkham Asylum.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.79,1:53:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.13,1:53:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我也杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.71,1:53:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就象你杀我妻子那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as you killed my wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.51,1:53:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没杀你妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't kill your wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.22,1:53:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我拔掉Fries小姐的插头时说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I told Lady Fries when I pulled her plug…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.52,1:53:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个女人的表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}… this is a one-woman show.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.61,1:54:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.28,1:54:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了她 把她又放回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found her, restored her.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.78,1:54:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还被冰冻着 还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still frozen alive…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.28,1:54:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你找到治疗方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}…waiting for you to find a cure.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.29,1:54:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She lives?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.74,1:54:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 她还活着！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes - She lives!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.29,1:54:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇不代表力量每个人都能夺取生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}But vengeance isn't power. Anyone can take a life.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.17,1:54:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但赐予生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to give life…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.25,1:54:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,才是真正的力量你曾经拥有的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that's true power. A power you once had.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.30,1:54:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.85,1:54:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm asking you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.48,1:54:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Victor Fries\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor Fries…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.94,1:54:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我拯救另一条生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…help me save another life.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.27,1:54:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我如何治疗Macgregor综合症的第一阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me how to cure Macgregor's Syndrome Stage 1.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.78,1:54:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你就能拯救一个 你妻子曾经爱过的男人的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe you can also save the life of the man your wife once loved.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.49,1:54:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在你体内 Victor\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still inside you, Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.58,1:54:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,埋在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buried.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.95,1:55:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,深深地雪下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}deep beneath the snow.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.67,1:55:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you help me…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.88,1:55:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.70,1:55:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这两个拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take 2 of these.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.99,1:55:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天早上找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and call me in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.46,1:55:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你妻子送到Arkham的实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have your wife moved to the lab at Arkham.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.34,1:55:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以在那里继续你的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be able to continue your research there.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.37,1:56:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在能做的就是等\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we can do now is wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.37,1:56:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.23,1:56:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loves me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.98,1:56:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loves me not.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.03,1:56:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loves me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.66,1:56:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loves me not.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.44,1:56:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loves me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.77,1:56:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loves me not.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.95,1:56:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loves me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.45,1:56:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不爱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.45,1:57:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.16,1:57:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的新室友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your new cellmate.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.54,1:57:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来把你送进地狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've come to make your life a living hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.75,1:57:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.96,1:57:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,吞下你自己种下的恶果吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a bitter harvest.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.47,1:57:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,冬天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winter…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.97,1:57:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has come at last.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.28,1:58:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.60,1:58:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.60,1:58:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很失望 我没好好教你怎么把持家务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rather disappointed at how poorly I have taught you proper housekeeping.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.86,1:58:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很不错！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And quite well, it seems!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.15,1:58:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to you, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.69,1:58:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们大家.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to you all.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.16,1:58:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的不错 Bruce\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.12,1:58:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也干的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.54,1:58:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got one question.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.41,1:58:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当蝙蝠女孩和我掉下望远镜时 为什么你不救我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we fell off the telescope, why didn't you try and save us?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.33,1:58:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次我掉下去时 你也没去抓住我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the first time I've fallen and you weren't there.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.17,1:58:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你能自己解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured you could handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.63,1:58:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 有时互相帮助 才是唯一的取胜之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, sometimes counting on somebody else is the only way to win.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.22,1:58:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.22,1:58:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为是我解决了lvy的那些植物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who kicked Ivy's botanical butt.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.85,1:58:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.18,1:58:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个就搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.77,1:58:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.98,1:58:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要回学校去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are going back to school.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.74,1:58:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bruce 你永远不会赢得这场争论的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never win this argument.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.24,1:59:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍档？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Partners?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.41,1:59:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Partners.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.75,1:59:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Partners.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.01,1:59:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一个更大的蝙蝠洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to need a bigger cave.
